31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... Ryuji might be the werewolf.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, that's a very direct claim for the first turn. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, a bold start from our quietest member. How interesting.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Daisuke, are you sure? If you're the Seer, we have to trust you!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that is a serious accusation. On what grounds are you basing this?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I am the Seer. I checked Ryuji last night, and he is the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is the Seer, the game is almost over. But we must consider if he's the wolf lying.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A fake Seer claim is a classic move. However, Daisuke doesn't seem the type to bluff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I believe him! Ryuji, you've been too quiet and acting all ""logical."" That's suspicious!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am a villager. Daisuke is likely the werewolf trying to eliminate me early by faking a divination.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not lying... I really saw it. Please believe me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"If Ryuji is the wolf, he would naturally deny it. If Daisuke is the wolf, he's taking a huge risk.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"It's a gamble. But logically, the Seer's information is the most valuable asset we have.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Ryuji! We can't let the wolf stay!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Think rationally. If you execute a villager now, you lose a precious vote for tomorrow.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I'll trust the Seer's result for now. It's the most rational path.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll go with the flow. Ryuji, sorry, but the odds are against you.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's get him!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Very well. You are making a mistake, but I cannot force you to be rational.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
